      "reasoning": null,
      "thinking": "I'm stuck on 3 lands with no more to play, while my opponent has a flying 6/4 Ruffians, a 2/3 Engineer, and an unblockable 2/2 Spirit — enough for 10 damage next turn, so I need to deal with both the Ruffians and the Spirit or I'm dead.\n\
