- Tundra Tank {2}{B} [Uncommon] Firebending 1 <i>(Whenever this creature attacks, add {R}. This mana lasts until end of combat.)</i> When {this} enters, target creature you control gains indestructible until end of turn. Crew 1 <i>(Tap any number of creatures you control with total power 1 or more: This Vehicle becomes an artifact creature until end of turn.)</i>\n\
